<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When the woes of life o’ertake me,</l><l>Hopes deceive, and fears annoy,</l><l>Never shall the cross forsake me,</l><l>Lo! It glows with peace and joy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When the sun of bliss is beaming</l><l>Light and love upon my way,</l><l>From the cross the radiance streaming</l><l>Adds more luster to the day.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Bane and blessing, pain and pleasure,</l><l>By the cross are sanctified;</l><l>Peace is there that knows no measure,</l><l>Joys that through all time abide.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
